        text: 'Sit down at a table at O’Reilly’s Restaurant Bar, Pasaje de Matheu 4 — restaurant-first, not a standing first pint and not a lunch-then-Bengals plan. Usual from 11:30; pin the table now if the door is still shut. At 14:00 hop to Four Corner, Calle de la Victoria 6 (sports screens, not open before). Espoz y Mina 7 (Dubliners and O’Connell’s) is the other hop. Maps below.',
